Ziro Devices — Product Images Folder
=====================================

How to use product images:

OPTION A (Recommended for quick use):
  In Admin → Upload Image button
  Image is saved in browser (works immediately)

OPTION B (Images inside this folder):
  1. Put your image files in this "images" folder
     Example: images/air13.jpg, images/blade15.png
  2. Open Admin → product → Image field
  3. Type the path: images/air13.jpg
  4. Save All Changes

Supported: JPG, PNG, WebP, GIF
Tip: Keep each image under 1.5 MB for best performance.
